  "bodyHash": "4d47a36df9dbe299",
  "content": "\n\n<p>如果您正在寻找 Forge 版本，就在这里！&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams</a></p>\n<p>在我们的文档网站上了解更多关于 FTB Teams 的信息：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-teams</a></p>\n<p>供其他模组使用的依赖库，可集成团队进度功能（如 FTB Chunks 和 FTB Quests）。在任务系统中，它允许多人共同完成相同的任务；在区块管理中，它支持团队成员间对方块进行交互，无需额外添加白名单。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>要创建团队，请使用命令 \"/ftbteams create 名称\"。若要更改设置，请使用 \"/ftbteams settings &lt;key&gt; &lt;value&gt;\"，按 Tab 键可循环查看可用选项。团队数据将保存在 world/data/ftbteams 文件夹中。</p>\n<h2>获取支持</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如遇 <strong>整合包</strong> 相关问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>如遇 <strong>模组</strong> 相关问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有任何疑问？欢迎加入我们的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持关注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
